# Build trees: extracted from the vendored tarballs by build/*.sh, never edited
# in place. Everything here is reproducible from xroar/ and lwasm/.
#
# GLOBBED, NOT PINNED. These used to name 1.12.1 and 4.25 exactly, which meant
# that the first person to drop in a newer tarball made a 24 MB autotools tree
# committable -- and `git add -A` would have taken it without a word. The
# scripts derive the directory from $VER; this is the one place that cannot.
/xroar-[0-9]*/
/lwasm/lwtools-[0-9]*/

# Built binaries: reproducible from the tarballs + patches
/bin/

# Cross-build output
*.exe
*.dll
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.d
*.la
*.lo

# Run artefacts. Every recipe in README.md and BUILD.md writes into the cwd,
# which is the repo root -- traps, profiles, audits and snapshots all land here.
/*.sna
/*.ram
/*.png
/*.log
/*.sym
/*.lines
/audit.bin
/profile.txt
/obj/

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor and OS litter
*~
*.swp
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
